00:01:28.666 --> 00:01:32.266 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Dans son avis de paiement,

00:01:29.900 --> 00:01:33.500 size:53% position:73% line:53%
le gouveemement donne

00:01:31.133 --> 00:01:34.733 size:53% position:73% line:53%
